    "## Architecture and decision boundaries\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Symbol + question + Student 1 controls\n",
    "                  │\n",
    "        JSON memory lessons ────────────────┐\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "       Student 2 source planner             │\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "   Tool manager -> student 1 providers      │\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "   Preprocess -> classify → extract         │\n",
    "              -> summarize → digest         │\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "       Router: earnings / news / market     │\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "       Student 3 specialist drafts          │\n",
    "                  ▼                         │\n",
    "     Evaluator ── feedback → revise once    │\n",
    "          │                                 │\n",
    "          ├── thin news → broaden once      │\n",
    "          ▼                                 │\n",
    "   Selected snapshot → report → reflection ─┘\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Provider failure handling, data retrieval optimization and analysis revision\n",
    "are distinct decisions. Prior memory guides behavior; it is never current\n",
    "financial evidence. Native provider function calling is not claimed: the\n",
    "planner validates JSON source-group choices and the registry executes tools.\n",
