    "### Shared contracts\n",
    "\n",
    "- `tool_result` is the common `{ok, source, data, error}` envelope.\n",
    "- `NewsArticle` and `ProcessedArticle` retain Student 1's schemas. DataBundle sections are `market`, `fundamentals`, `filings`, `macro`, `news`,\n",
    "  `external_sentiment`, `sources`, and `pipeline_meta`. Student 2 validates the bundle before routing. Student 3 uses `analyze_packet(role, packet, feedback=None, lessons=None)`,\n",
    "  `evaluate_research(bundle, analyses, plan)` and `build_report(...)` directly.\n"
   ]
