    "## Student 1 — Acquisition, preprocessing and NLP prompt chain\n",
    "Real providers remain available in live mode. Tool failures are recorded; live mode never substitutes synthetic articles. Prompts use prior chain outputs; numeric/citation gates are diagnostics, not full semantic verification.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 7 — Data tools\n",
    "\n",
    "Each function below is a **tool** in the architecture's Data & Tool Layer. All of them:\n",
    "1. take simple JSON-serializable arguments (so an LLM planner can call them),\n",
    "2. return the `tool_result` envelope,\n",
    "3. catch their own exceptions.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 7.1 — Market and company data — Yahoo Finance\n"
   ]
