    "## Step 15 — DataBundle collection pipeline\n",
    "The following cell defines the main data pipeline for researching a stock. It brings together the registered tools, news preprocessing, and news analysis into one structured result.\n",
    "ALL_SOURCES lists the supported source groups, and SOURCE_OF_TOOL maps each tool to its group. These let callers choose which types of data to collect.\n",
    "run_data_pipeline() then:\n",
    "1. Validates the inputs. Normalizes the ticker—for example, \" $nvda \" becomes \"NVDA\"—and checks that the requested source groups are supported. By default, it includes all groups.\n",
    "2. Collects research data. Calls tools for two years of prices, company information, financial statements, earnings, peer comparisons, economic indicators, SEC filings, and SEC financial facts. A helper records each tool’s status and runtime, marking excluded tools as \"skipped\".\n",
    "3. Collects and analyzes news. Queries all three selected news providers—Yahoo Finance, NewsAPI, and Google RSS—and merges their articles. It then cleans, deduplicates, and filters the articles using preprocess_news(), runs run_news_chain() to produce article analysis and an overall digest, and separately retrieves Alpha Vantage sentiment.\n",
    "4. Builds a research bundle. Combines market data, fundamentals, filings, macroeconomic data, processed news, external sentiment, source links, and execution diagnostics into one dictionary.\n",
    "5. Optionally saves the results. With save=True, writes the bundle to JSON and available price, news, fundamentals, and macro data to CSV files. It also retains full DataFrames in the returned bundle’s \"_frames\" entry for charts and further analysis; these are added after the JSON is saved.\n",
    "A few behavior details: news providers are queried and merged rather than used as sequential fallbacks. Sample news is only inserted when LIVE is false, news is selected, no articles were returned, and use_sample_if_empty=True. The news preprocessing and analysis functions still run even when the news source group is excluded.\n",
    "Overall, this cell turns multiple data sources into a single research package ready for downstream analysis and reporting."
   ]
  },
