   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This step brings togther the analysis and the quality audits into a synthesized research report. To tackle both the challenges sparked by the generation of hallucinations and keep RAG grounded as pointed out by Chapter 11 of Jurafsky & Martin (2026) and in the LangChain Docs Retrival Augmented Generation (RAG) with Deep Agents tutorial (2026), the report builder tracks citations and links directly to verified source hyperlinks.\n",
    "\n",
    "The report combines specialist analysis and diagnostic results. Source URLs are provenance links; their presence does not certify that every generated claim is supported. Claim-level review must compare the statement with the actual source excerpt, period and unit. The generated report has its own consecutive section numbering, independent of notebook steps."
   ]
